						<command class_type='comment' title='' comment='Main Basic overview of a I²C Read transaction

1) Start transaction
2) Send device address with read/write bit = 0
3) Send internal EEPROM address MSB
4) Send internal EEPROM address LSB
5) Send a restart command
6) Send device address with read/write bit = 1
5) Read n data bytes from the memory
6) Stop transaction' textarea='12,0,12,0' />
						<command class_type='call' title='Call Component Macro' component='LCDDisplay' macro='Cursor' >
